1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,653
Fearless Draft bans every champion used in
earlier games of a series.

2
00:00:04,653 --> 00:00:10,234
By game five a coach is tracking roughly
fifty unavailable champions, on a thirty
second timer.

3
00:00:10,234 --> 00:00:12,349
Most of them do it in a spreadsheet.

4
00:00:13,849 --> 00:00:14,867
This is Fearless.

5
00:00:14,867 --> 00:00:17,982
One click loads a real best of five, three
games in.

6
00:00:19,482 --> 00:00:21,544
Thirty champions are already burned.

7
00:00:21,544 --> 00:00:23,492
They do not vanish from the board.

8
00:00:23,492 --> 00:00:32,717
Each one stays, struck through, carrying a
chip for the game that took it, because a
pool that silently shrinks is the
spreadsheet problem again in a nicer font.

9
00:00:34,217 --> 00:00:35,168
Now the advisor.

10
00:00:35,168 --> 00:00:39,984
It proposes five champions for red's next
pick, and it has no idea what is legal.

11
00:00:39,984 --> 00:00:43,969
It is a priority sheet, exactly like the
one a coach actually uses.

12
00:00:45,469 --> 00:00:48,272
Four of its five suggestions are already
gone.

13
00:00:48,272 --> 00:00:55,279
Every one was caught by deterministic code
before it reached the screen, and labelled
with the game that burned it.

14
00:00:55,279 --> 00:00:56,437
The model proposes.

15
00:00:56,437 --> 00:00:57,960
The rules engine decides.

16
00:00:59,461 --> 00:01:01,640
Nothing is hidden from the coach either.

17
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:07,960
A blocked suggestion stays on screen with
the reason, so they learn why it is gone
instead of watching it disappear.

18
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:11,407
Type to search, press enter to lock.

19
00:01:11,407 --> 00:01:14,383
Nobody hunts for a text field on a thirty
second timer.

20
00:01:15,883 --> 00:01:19,276
Export the series, reload the page, import
it back.

21
00:01:19,276 --> 00:01:24,799
The draft returns exactly as it was, so a
laptop dying between games costs nothing.

22
00:01:26,299 --> 00:01:29,435
One hundred and two tests, no network and
no API key.

23
00:01:29,435 --> 00:01:37,305
The engine matches hand computed ground
truth on ten series states, and across
them the gate refused twenty one of fifty
suggestions.
